#. (itstool) path: plugin/_short
#. (itstool) path: group/_short
#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "自启动"

#. (itstool) path: plugin/_long
msgid "A plugin to run shell commands on startup."
msgstr "在启动时运行 Shell 命令的插件。"

#. (itstool) path: group/_long
msgid "Specifies the shell commands to run on startup."
msgstr "指定启动时要运行的 Shell 命令。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Executes shell command with `sh` on startup. The program ID does not matter, "
"but must be different for distinct commands."
msgstr "启动时使用 `sh` 执行 Shell 命令。程序 ID 本身无关紧要，但不同命令必须使用不同的 ID。"

#. (itstool) path: option/_short
msgid "Autostart shell clients"
msgstr "自启动 Shell 客户端"

#. (itstool) path: option/_long
msgid ""
"Start wf-panel and wf-background if they are not listed as autostart entries."
msgstr "如果 wf-panel 和 wf-background 未列在自启动项中，则启动它们。"
